The Awakening is a 1980 supernatural horror film directed by Mike Newell in his directorial
debut and starring Charlton Heston, Susannah York, and Stephanie Zimbalist.

11
00:57:45,000 --> 00:57:51,000
The film follows an archeologist whose daughter becomes
possessed by an ancient Egyptian queen.

12
01:03:00,000 --> 01:03:06,000
It is the third film version of Bram Stoker's 1903 novel The Jewel of Seven Stars, following the 1970 television adaptation as The Curse of the Mummy for the
TV series Mystery and Imagination, and the 1971 theatrical film by Hammer, Blood from the Mummy's Tomb (in which Ahmed Osman also appeared).

13
01:08:15,000 --> 01:08:21,000
A co-production between the United States and the United Kingdom,
the film was shot in England and Egypt in 1979.

14
01:13:30,000 --> 01:13:36,000
It was released by Orion Pictures, then a subsidiary of Warner Bros.,
premiering in the United States on Halloween 1980.

15
01:18:45,000 --> 01:18:51,000
The film earned $8.4 million at the U.S.

16
