box office.

17
01:29:15,000 --> 01:29:21,000
Two different cuts of The Awakening exist: Newell's original cut, running approximately 105 minutes, which was released in the United Kingdom; and a
shorter cut edited by Monte Hellman, running approximately 101 minutes, which was released in North America under mandate from Warner Bros.

